{"4190960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOST & FOUND", "steam_appid": 4190960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5044200, 5044210], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS MY JOB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, lost items are brought to your warehouse. Your job is to help people get them back! Pick up a form with a detailed description, find the lost item, and return it to its owner. That's gonna be easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN I BUILD IN THIS GAME?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sooner or later, you will realize that without proper organization of your workplace, everything you do is pointless. That's why you have to take care of it yourself! Arrange your warehouse with various shelves and containers so that it makes your job easier. Office space is no less important! What would it be without the ability to set your favorite cat as wallpaper or plaster the entire office with its photos? Does it serve any purpose? No, but it's fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/1d64049d5535c9e39d555cb873bf0545.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/1d64049d5535c9e39d555cb873bf0545.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/1d64049d5535c9e39d555cb873bf0545.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JUST ADD MULTIPLAYER BRO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I already did! If you think working at LOST &amp; FOUND is chaotic, wait until you discover arcade mode. Invite your friends and jump into the whirlwind of lost junk together, trying to find the right item before time runs out, working together in Co-op mode or competing in PvP gameplay. Good luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/a90e6a3f97b36bd4e309e3ca0cbe5343.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/a90e6a3f97b36bd4e309e3ca0cbe5343.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/a90e6a3f97b36bd4e309e3ca0cbe5343.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/f2f9d4f83714ea0b8208bc823e5f2d31.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS MY JOB?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, lost items are brought to your warehouse. Your job is to help people get them back! Pick up a form with a detailed description, find the lost item, and return it to its owner. That's gonna be easy, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.poster.avif?t=1787476428\" width=840 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.webm?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4190960/extras/d1417c74664b3f3927b05b7ad1af9533.mp4?t=1787476428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN I BUILD IN THIS GAME?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sooner or later, you will realize that without proper organization of your workplace, everything 